  <description>
    <p>This is a community package of MailCraft, maintained independently and unaffiliated with the MailCraft contributors. It repackages the official upstream Linux build unmodified.</p>
    <p>MailCraft reads and writes mail, and keeps a calendar, contacts and tasks. It talks to IMAP and SMTP servers and opens .eml, .mbox, .ics and .vcf files. No account is set up until you add one.</p>
    <p>Sandbox: display, GPU, network for mail servers, the Documents and Pictures folders, the keyring for saved sign-ins, and notifications. Updates come through FlatPark. On the first launch this package turns off the daily update check in MailCraft's own settings; an existing settings file is left as it is, and the check can be turned back on in the program.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.billsecond.mailcraft.desktop</launchable>
